[{"title":"上报国寺毗卢阁","author":"陈衎","text":"十丈青莲朵朵开，毗卢高阁独崔嵬。\n欲看山势连天远，已见河流带雨来。\n宫树阴浓秋未落，塞鸿声断晚尤哀。\n烽烟直北何时息，处处关门鼓角催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李芳生还白下","author":"陈衎","text":"娘嬛古洞旧藏名，岂但诗文独主盟。\n莫令杜鹃愁邵子，姑从蝴蝶梦庄生。\n窗寒流水芦风切，门响邻庄竹雪轻。\n若上星台占列宿，何时楚豫落欃枪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐读书有感效坡老作短诗寄允兆翁晋季豹三子","author":"茅维","text":"石床横素书，漆灯挂青焰。\n引幞不耐眠，危坐意清宴。\n瓦盆覆残茗，绮石当圜砚。\n索笔赋短章，书成自精绚。\n冷月侵疏槐，荒山噭荒鸡。\n虫吟豆花中，叶坠石苔面。\n垂头何所思，阑干忽凭遍。\n一入静者怀，机锋似□箭。\n恨无三益友，相对发绮辨。\n露湿还松房，青林火不见。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病里思听音乐戏呈诸公","author":"茅维","text":"绕篱黄蝶隐秋花，病里闲情遣狭斜。\n伎作东山怀谢傅，笛吹古墓忆桓家。\n那堪残曲歌《金缕》，敢向今时斗丽华。\n红烛最娇丸髻妓，胡床企脚听琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁酉北还述怀呈社中诸子","author":"茅维","text":"长河帆底夕阳浑，路入乡关思转繁。\n水涸舳舻徒满眼，天低禾黍只孤村。\n那堪宿雁冲沙噭，更指寒鸦背雨屯。\n河朔建儿仍不忘，紫缰白马炤秋原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春昼戏咏","author":"茅维","text":"春昼阴阴度网窗，春愁极目荡春江。\n不知何处吹花片，忽有余香到佛幢。\n红药风翻娇第一，紫丁烟湿艳无双。\n如侬自爱空林绿，绣遍苔钱带壁缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄讯李白父征君二首 其一","author":"茅维","text":"闻君老病掩双扉，秋老荒园黄蝶飞。\n手爨青松饭香稻，隔溪人语采菱归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄讯李白父征君二首 其二","author":"茅维","text":"病忘真是息心方，兀坐支颐木脚床。\n天末凉风吹老树，看他屋角送斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答宋季子","author":"茅维","text":"秋光晴映薜门开，坐客胡床趣举杯。\n若问吴侬忙底事，前溪斫荻月明回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书所见","author":"茅维","text":"台躔初见黑头人，受策延登圣眷新。\n莫怪三公更年少，单于惊起贺贤臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清远峡","author":"吴拭","text":"雨过山气清，两禺望相峙。\n树里出钟声，烟澄满江水。\n熠熠林光中，露重滴松子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浈阳峡","author":"吴拭","text":"清晨醉别曲江守，直下浈阳望峡口。\n须臾舟子亦动容，两岸高插数百峰。\n日气在峡吐不得，苍岚紫霭霏濛濛。\n下视潭影无天色，但见石根没深黑。\n十丈岩头灵乳开，百寻壁上暮钟回。\n余峰一一断复续，蓊葱各欲出风雷。\n舟中野客苦残病，决眦支颐揽奇胜。\n不堪夕色下遥阴，翠微枕上寒相竞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观稻","author":"石沆","text":"稻水千区映，村烟几处斜。\n泠风低起树，轻浪细浮花。\n鸟雀深深圃，凫鹥浅浅沙。\n社歌声不绝，于此见年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扫张氏妇墓","author":"石沆","text":"云归巫峡雨阳台，杜宇声声唤不回。\n惟有春风最怜惜，墓田收拾纸钱灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵纪梦","author":"石沆","text":"春尽他乡梦，云林思杳然。\n落花溪水上，斜日洞门前。\n鹤去游城郭，春来弄管弦。\n倚阑怀胜事，光细月初弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿城中旧房","author":"石沆","text":"从教雁侣失潇湘，春色年年暗洞房。\n遗得一枝花影子，夜深随月转西廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦中吟","author":"石沆","text":"树老何年寺，山深此夜钟。\n一僧眉拄地，教我学南宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口号送邻家米","author":"石沆","text":"东邻雨湿火难吹，斗米田家尚可为。\n晚稻未舂潮水白，早红先送救公饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题主人壁间樊素小蛮图","author":"石沆","text":"江州司马两红妆，水墨何人画此堂。\n得似往年歌意思，却看今日舞衣裳。\n摸声漫点樱珠破，拟态轻拖柳带长。\n别有幽情传笔底，主人狂得且须狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟寒山我见世中人二首 其一","author":"石沆","text":"我见世中人，日夜心兵动。\n布帛不遮寒，齑盐不塞空。\n欲求安乐法，错认逍遥梦。\n米大一粒珠，分应六门用。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟寒山我见世中人二首 其二","author":"石沆","text":"我见世中人，开口便讲理。\n将理与人争，还是不明理。\n多争理在伊，少争理在你。\n争人所不争，不争之争矣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新春杂兴","author":"石沆","text":"一囊置我琴，一囊置我笛。\n明月照寒江，扁舟吊采石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴二首 其一","author":"石沆","text":"竹影清溪路，花藏白石岩。\n病偏宜短褐，老不废长镵。\n阶水鹅儿浴，池泥燕子衔。\n尽堪吟弄去，风月两三函。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴二首 其二","author":"石沆","text":"窗下兀兀坐，人闲事事疏。\n乱山看过画，堆案读残书。\n细雨衔杯后，微风隐几余。\n不劳渔父问，方寸已空虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"石沆","text":"落日早凉归，看山倚竹扉。\n水清仍可鉴，云薄不成衣。\n腐草萤低照，疏林鸟乱飞。\n平生蓑笠意，不在富春矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文翼侄草堂","author":"石沆","text":"结构离人境，经营到野田。\n春光莺语外，秋色雁行边。\n室小刚容膝，墙高不过肩。\n个中些子意，应与会人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去岁中秋","author":"石沆","text":"去岁中秋月，江南水上天。\n剥菱烦伎手，煮茗汲僧泉。\n即事浑如昨，追欢已隔年。\n算迟婚嫁了，还弄五湖烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜听琵琶","author":"石沆","text":"娉婷少妇未关愁，清夜琵琶上小楼。\n裂帛一声江月白，碧云飞起四山秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲中喜慕溪兄见过","author":"石沆","text":"釭裤满晴沙，江村好岁华。\n投竿鱼浪细，举袂燕风斜。\n林竹初开笋，溪莼正有花。\n得君相聚首，沽酒问谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归来吟","author":"石沆","text":"只成无喜亦无憎，随处看山倚瘦藤。\n烟雨楼台浑在寺，水蔬家世半皈僧。\n一闲可敌三公贵，只眼真传六祖灯。\n漫道秋江鱼事美，月明空坐板桥罾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答友人书寄","author":"石沆","text":"自笑年来休未休，空劳梦语说虚舟。\n尘埃未脱饥寒累，稼穑宁忘水旱忧。\n难道琴书间北牖，也曾风雨事西畴。\n余生只不填沟壑，此外分毫无所求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边","author":"石沆","text":"昨夜溪桥上，南畦看稻还。\n解襟聊濯足，对影暂开颜。\n群动无时息，几人如我闲。\n独行还独坐，凉月上东山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日寄怀南逸士","author":"石沆","text":"南邻何异北山居，黄草衣裳白草庐。\n闲却农桑事吟弄，不教风月著空虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋思","author":"石沆","text":"旷野碧云暮，园林白露秋。\n水花清瑟瑟，窗竹冷修修。\n索莫惟禁酒，踌躇欲上楼。\n相思不相见，多病益多愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀","author":"石沆","text":"远村幽壑独徘徊，云护柴扉雪护苔。\n尽日溪边倚枯柳，白鸥何事不飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄莲宇上人","author":"石沆","text":"忆昔相从春水残，桃花映竹鸟啼山。\n半年好景违僧舍，十月西风凋客颜。\n短褐羞如黄叶舞，方袍定似白云闲。\n草堂莲社天南北，惆怅幽期隔往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜催花","author":"石沆","text":"漏鼓无声清露寒，西楼残月夜漫漫。\n飞觞莫讶花催急，世界宜横醉眼看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与二十二弟","author":"石沆","text":"曾骑竹马妄追风，经世衰荣约略同。\n俱是贱人牛口下，未离故态雁行中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新墙门","author":"石沆","text":"北屋连江面远峰，水禽山鹿谩相从。\n径因待月还宜曲，门为藏春再设重。\n雨暗蘼芜分绿锁，天晴杨柳借云封。\n攻琴乐酒年来癖，更好垂帘称懒慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄敏上人","author":"石沆","text":"别来多雨更多风，野水苍茫浸碧空。\n惆怅数枝憔悴柳，不堪持赠胆瓶中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客有姑苏约奉柬","author":"石沆","text":"松院袈裟苇岸罾，太湖渔父虎丘僧。\n因君来约同相访，月好风清能不能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮慕溪所惠酒","author":"石沆","text":"是时天气炎，人事难调摄。\n饮水过于寒，饮汤过于热。\n得君之所惠，清净如油洁。\n不用脱巾漉，不用置篘?。\n亦不用多人，夫妇西廊月。\n一盏四肢畅，两盏百情灭。\n三盏即醺醺，五藏皆融泄。\n本不爱贪杯，独醒难过日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂兴","author":"石沆","text":"饱罢披书便理瓜，闲中谁道没生涯。\n遣情亦要宽沽酒，醒睡还须窄煮茶。\n细草篱根侵病菊，古苔阶面覆残花。\n傍人不解侬家事，只道贪闲不管家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自咏","author":"石沆","text":"我有安乐处，名为建德乡。\n唱于风起籁，虚白月生光。\n自谓青云馆，何惭绿野堂。\n傍窗低竹几，临水小绳床。\n居士斋时卧，先生醉后狂。\n眼前无异物，身外有余粮。\n蔬食寻常饭，荤腥间或尝。\n净神三遍咒，暖室一炉香。\n念念归真境，心心向道场。\n世间安饱事，一切不思量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"破屋","author":"石沆","text":"三间破屋两间空，廊壁萧然西复东。\n惨恻岂宜愁坐客，清虚聊称病眠翁。\n敢将道义夸汾水，惟有诗歌抵雒中。\n客到消闲无一物，竹窗明月柳桥风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"石沆","text":"江村此夕意如何，道是桥平水不波。\n仿佛空中倚楼阁，分明镜里现山河。\n当筵自对贤人酒，得意闲吟孺子歌。\n明月若教陪尽夜，只拚清露湿渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闰重阳邀众社集座中又呈一律","author":"石沆","text":"两回风景惜重阳，倏见秋容变故常。\n杨柳叶干前夜雨，芙蓉花老及时霜。\n极知酒是消愁物，何处台非戏马场。\n拉得相知开口笑，不嫌醉倒菊篱傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮不及去城中偶吟","author":"石沆","text":"空野平无盗，长河冻绝船。\n城中未可去，江上正堪眠。\n饱饭何曾缺，烧柴不费钱。\n且从俗人语，打夥过残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移居城中柬招溪上两兄","author":"石沆","text":"荆树江城隔，梅花岁事残。\n曾经知别苦，敢道路行难。\n冻雪销泥湿，霜风吹面寒。\n一尊今到手，来为话辛酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中","author":"石沆","text":"冰涧拥流澌，春回万壑姿。\n水清鱼尾活，泥泞马蹄迟。\n城郭来将晚，江村到几时。\n欲沽无好店，何日有新诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门拟白三十首（录二首） 其一","author":"石沆","text":"何处春偏胜，江门自好风。\n酒旗斜路口，花信短墙东。\n多病一居士，双鬟二小童。\n题诗嵩雒去，可是白家翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门拟白三十首（录二首） 其二","author":"石沆","text":"何处春偏胜，江门旧草堂。\n和风团燕雀，迟日散牛羊。\n细草当窗绿，残花隔水香。\n老狂犹稚子，拍手咏沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈山人","author":"盛鸣世","text":"落落寻常路，遑遑二十年。\n许身吾老矣，干世尔徒然。\n春日当垆酒，都城卖卜钱。\n有身堪自足，不必众人怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送泰州李太守","author":"盛鸣世","text":"不复关时论，将因与世违。\n受金廉吏枉，疑璧众人非。\n淮海孤舟别，匡山白首归。\n天寒江上雁，但恐尺书稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠隐者","author":"盛鸣世","text":"只在高霞外，无人识去踪。\n伴猿栖一室，放鹤下孤峰。\n丹灶云中火，青天夜半钟。\n平生长往意，相望不相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日","author":"盛鸣世","text":"曝背便暄暖，灰心任岁时。\n衰年聊对酒，至日一题诗。\n洗药冰初薄，探梅雪半垂。\n转应贫与病，不厌老相随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈水部官署","author":"盛鸣世","text":"江水流何急，归心却似之。\n已伤为客久，转恨别君时。\n断雁迷寒渚，吟猿挂冷枝。\n生涯兼物色，何处不堪悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送柯孝廉之巴东兼呈黄广文","author":"盛鸣世","text":"去问巴江水，荆门更向西。\n挂帆秋叶落，上峡夜猿啼。\n旧侣伤飘泊，新欢惜解携。\n湘潭憔悴地，已恐旅魂迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶汝习病目移住西山戏简","author":"盛鸣世","text":"病懒因怜汝，深山且辟人。\n佛堂云共宿，僧语夜相亲。\n就石分泉冷，和钟杵药匀。\n不知天眼里，何处着微尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送临江苏太守","author":"盛鸣世","text":"五马夹朱轮，清川不动尘。\n问山庐岳近，领郡虎符新。\n吏冗诗难废，民稀俗易淳。\n江花迎路发，十月待行春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避暑吕叔与园亭因赠","author":"盛鸣世","text":"辟暑谁堪适，壶冰若可餐。\n一闻高士论，六月使人寒。\n云起峰阴直，亭孤日气残。\n晚来山更好，不碍隔篱看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西楼月下送陆长康","author":"盛鸣世","text":"分散欢娱地，班骓送陆郎。\n乌啼白门夜，月上一楼霜。\n扬子分衣带，明河接泪行。\n大刀重有约，团扇莫相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月八日潞河舟中别长安诸子","author":"盛鸣世","text":"天汉龙初返，星桥鹊乍分。\n隔河收片雨，宿浦有残云。\n复作孤舟别，兼悲一叶闻。\n相看此时恨，不独在离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孙憨生","author":"盛鸣世","text":"草色青门外，杨花白雪边。\n伤心犹昨日，转眼向秋天。\n干世真何意，还家始自怜。\n萧条淮水上，谁复问残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过程孺父","author":"盛鸣世","text":"摇落秦淮上，依然见索居。\n客贫亲旧少，家难死生余。\n土锉朝烟冷，荒池古木疏。\n日斜殊未去，狼籍一床书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送毛广文之云中","author":"盛鸣世","text":"岁晏单车去，穷边不算程。\n河冰寻马迹，关月逐鸡声。\n野烧云中戍，春天雪外城。\n战场应久定，问业有儒生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李雪舟","author":"盛鸣世","text":"有客留行迹，令人一解颜。\n听钟寻晓寺，沽酒看春山。\n老病能相就，禅心许共闲。\n如何芳草色，又送马蹄还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿麻河","author":"盛鸣世","text":"积雨湖田没，居人生事微。\n白鱼休市早，乌鬼载船归。\n月黑村舂尽，林深岸火稀。\n纬萧眠不定，中夜赋《无衣》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过华子澄","author":"盛鸣世","text":"柳市南头路，三年此重过。\n长贫为客倦，高卧奈君何。\n岭背夕阳尽，月明秋水多。\n徘徊那能去，门外即烟波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]